Lensfun calibration database extracts
====================================

The XML data in tests/data/ and the corresponding saved XML and calibration
entries in ../../golden/lens/ are extracts of the Lensfun database.
Copyright: Lensfun contributors and the calibration contributors named in the
retained XML comments. Original project: https://lensfun.github.io/
Database project: https://github.com/lensfun/lensfun/tree/master/data/db

